2 SAIPE Data for FY24 Perkins Formula</a></li>\r\n\t</ul>\r\n\t</dd>\r\n</dl>\r\n\r\n<dl class=\"ckeditor-accordion\">\r\n\t<dt>2019–2023 Archive</dt>\r\n\t<dd>\r\n\t<ul>\r\n\t\t<li><a data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"4005ad96-df2b-4017-8153-cfce284215d2\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/PerkinsVTransitionPlan_FINAL_1.pdf\">Transition Plan</a></li>\r\n\t\t<li>Stakeholders</li>\r\n\t</ul>\r\n\t</dd>\r\n</dl>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"contact-cube\">\r\n<h3><strong>Contact</strong></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Melissa Sherwood</strong><br>\r\n<em>Perkins Grant Manager</em><br>\r\n<strong>Phone:</strong> 207-816-2023<br>\r\n<strong>Email:</strong> <a href=\"mailto:melissa.sherwood@maine.gov\">melissa.sherwood@maine.gov</a></p>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n","after":"<div class=\"doe-hero\">\n<p class=\"doe-eyebrow\">Career and Technical Education</p>\n<p class=\"doe-contact-link\"><a href=\"#contact\">Contact</a></p>\n<p class=\"doe-lead\"><strong>Strengthening Career and Technical Education for the 21st Century Act (Perkins V)</strong> — <a href=\"https://www.congress.gov/115/plaws/publ224/PLAW-115publ224.pdf\">Read the Act</a></p>\n\n</div>\n\r\n\r\n<p>The purpose of this federal act is to develop more fully the academic knowledge and technical and employability skills of secondary and postsecondary students who elect to enroll in career and technical education programs and programs of study.</p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\r\n<div class=\"col-sm-4 py-2\">\r\n<div class=\"card h-100\">\r\n<div class=\"card-header text-white bg-primary\"><strong>State Plan</strong></div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"card-body\">\r\n<p>The State of Maine is required to have a Perkins V State Plan outlining how federal CTE funds will be used.</p>\n<p>\r\n<a class=\"btn btn-info btn-lg btn-block mt-4\" href=\"https://www.maine.gov/doe/learning/cte/perkinsv/stateplan\">View State Plan</a></p>\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"col-sm-4 py-2\">\r\n<div class=\"card h-100\">\r\n<div class=\"card-header text-white bg-primary\"><strong>Accountability</strong></div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"card-body\">\r\n<p>State of Maine performance levels for Perkins V, including the Consolidated Annual Report (CAR) due January 31st each year.</p>\n<p>\r\n<a class=\"btn btn-info btn-lg btn-block mt-4\" href=\"/doe/learning/cte/accountability\">View Accountability</a></p>\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"col-sm-4 py-2\">\r\n<div class=\"card h-100\">\r\n<div class=\"card-header text-white bg-primary\"><strong>Comprehensive Local Needs Assessment (CLNA)</strong></div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"card-body\">\r\n<p>Sub-recipients of Perkins are required to submit biennial local needs assessments through Grants4ME.</p>\r\n\r\n<ul class=\"list-group list-group-flush\">\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"https://youtu.be/tnJrUe25xGg\" aria-label=\"FY27 CLNA Overview Training, Recording\">FY27 CLNA Overview Training</a><span class=\"doe-chip\">Recording</span></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"https://youtu.be/EN2cSAyq3PY\" aria-label=\"FY27 CLNA Accountability Data Training, Recording\">FY27 CLNA Accountability Data Training</a><span class=\"doe-chip\">Recording</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\r\n<div class=\"col-sm-6 py-2\">\r\n<div class=\"card h-100\">\r\n<div class=\"card-header text-white bg-primary\"><strong>Maine DOE Federal Program Resources</strong></div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"card-body\">\r\n<p>See the Maine DOE Federal Programs Resources <a href=\"https://www.maine.gov/doe/federalprograms/resources\">website</a> for the federal grant management handbook, trainings, and other resources.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"col-sm-6 py-2\">\r\n<div class=\"card h-100\">\r\n<div class=\"card-header text-white bg-primary\"><strong>Federal Resources</strong></div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"card-body\">\r\n<ul class=\"list-group list-group-flush\">\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Allowable%20Uses%20of%20Funds.pdf\">Allowable Use of Funds</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"https://cte.ed.gov/legislation/perkins-v\">Perkins Collaborative Resource Network</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"https://maine.gov/doe/learning/cte/accountability\">Consolidated Annual Report (CAR)</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"blockhead\" id=\"perkins-formula-distributions-by-fiscal-year\">\r\n<h2>Perkins Formula &amp; Distributions by Fiscal Year</h2>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"ckeditor-accordion-container\">\r\n<dl class=\"ckeditor-accordion\">\r\n\t<dt><a href=\"#\">Fiscal Year 26 (FY26)</a></dt>\r\n\t<dd>\r\n\t<ul>\r\n\t\t<li class=\"doe-action\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/CTE%20-%20FY26%20Perkins%20Sec%20Allocations%20-%207.16.2025.pdf\">FY26 Secondary Awards by Local Recipient</a></li>\r\n\t\t<li class=\"doe-action\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/CTE%20-%20FY26%20Perkins%202023%20SAIPE%20Data%20-%207.16.2025.pdf\">2023 SAIPE Data for FY26 Perkins Formula</a></li>\r\n\t\t<li class=\"doe-action\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/CTE%20-%20FY26%20Perkins%20State%20Budget%20-%207.16.2025.pdf\">FY26 Maine Perkins Budget</a></li>\r\n\t\t<li class=\"doe-action\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/CTE%20-%20FY26%20Perkins%20Postsec%20Allocations%20-%207.16.2025.pdf\">FY26 Postsecondary Awards by Local Recipient</a></li>\r\n\t</ul>\r\n\t</dd>\r\n</dl>\r\n\r\n<dl class=\"ckeditor-accordion\">\r\n\t<dt><a href=\"#\">Fiscal Year 25 (FY25)</a></dt>\r\n\t<dd>\r\n\t<ul>\r\n\t\t<li class=\"doe-action\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/CTE%20-%20Perkins%20FY25%20Secondary%20Awards%20-%20